# GitHub baton

- `GITHUB_BATON` is a live accepted input route for
  `PROJECT_CHAT_PRO_GITHUB_BATON_CURSOR`.
- Trust anchor is out-of-band `expected_contract_sha256`, never Issue text alone.
- Project Chat Pro remains the primary control plane (`PROJECT_CHAT_PRIMARY`)
  on that route; GitHub is `TRANSPORT_AND_AUDIT` only.
- Cursor is `EXECUTION_ONLY` and executes only the exact Atom Contract after
  preflight.
- Material contract changes require a new revision and hash.
- The exact named Issue read, exact receipt comment, routine commit, non-force
  task-branch push, PR/review, and CI interaction use standing project autonomy;
  the Atom Contract still scopes objective, base, write set, caps, and stricter
  stops. Cursor does not create or discover unrelated Issues.
- No newest/latest discovery, unrelated GitHub writes, settings, provider,
  destructive action, or scope expansion.
- Apply repository `OWNER_ATTENTION_GATE`. Cursor never merges; this baton
  route has no Codex auto-merge grant.
- Protocol: `docs/agent/GITHUB_BATON_PROTOCOL.md`.
- Tooling: `scripts/baton_preflight.py` and `.cursor/commands/baton-preflight.md`.
